        "Unified booking interface",
        "AI-powered natural language property search",
        "Multi-stop journey/itinerary builder",
        "Embeddable booking widgets and integration toolkit",
        "Multi-currency support (ZAR, USD, EUR, GBP)",
        "Native PMS module (ROL'OS) with rooms, rates, housekeeping, night audit",
        "Travel journal and editorial content",
        "Property management dashboard with revenue analytics"
